Behavior notes (from post-refactor review):

- Standalone SSH tunnel startup now runs through SSHTunnel.connect and publishes
  to TabState.sshTunnel only after success; during startup cancel arrives via
  cooperative cancellation (checkCancellation between retries, NIOTS attempt
  timeout) instead of a synchronous stop(). Worst-case cancel latency during an
  in-flight attempt is bounded by connectionAttemptTimeout (~10s), not a hang.
- Shell-session tunnel startup is now wrapped in withTimeout(setupTimeout) and
  rejects an empty SSH host upfront; previously it had neither bound.
